# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 28
msgid ""
"If your Wi-Fi is already working, the built-in kernel driver is usually the "
"best option. Install an alternative only if you have connection problems."
msgstr ""
"Om ditt Wi-Fi redan fungerar är den inbyggda kärndrivrutinen vanligtvis det "
"bästa alternativet. Installera ett alternativ endast om du har "
"anslutningsproblem."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 33
msgid ""
"Wired network adapters almost always work out of the box. An extra driver is "
"only needed for very new or rare hardware."
msgstr ""
"Trådbundna nätverkskort fungerar nästan alltid direkt. En extra drivrutin "
"behövs bara för mycket ny eller ovanlig hårdvara."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 37
msgid ""
"Some Bluetooth adapters need extra firmware to work. If pairing fails, "
"installing the firmware for your adapter may solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"Vissa Bluetooth-adaptrar behöver extra firmware för att fungera. Om "
"parkopplingen misslyckas kan installation av firmware för din adapter lösa "
"problemet."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 42
msgid ""
"Digital TV tuners usually need specific firmware. Without it the device "
"won't be recognized by the system."
msgstr ""
"Digitala TV-mottagare behöver vanligtvis specifik firmware. Utan den kommer "
"enheten inte att kännas igen av systemet."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 46
msgid ""
"Most audio devices work with ALSA built into the kernel. Extra firmware is "
"only needed for specific USB audio interfaces."
msgstr ""
"De flesta ljudenheter fungerar med ALSA inbyggt i kärnan. Extra firmware "
"behövs bara för specifika USB-ljudgränssnitt."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 50
msgid ""
"Most webcams work automatically. Extra firmware may improve image quality or "
"enable additional features."
msgstr ""
"De flesta webbkameror fungerar automatiskt. Extra firmware kan förbättra "
"bildkvaliteten eller aktivera ytterligare funktioner."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 54
msgid ""
"If your touchscreen doesn't respond, installing the matching firmware "
"usually fixes it."
msgstr ""
"Om din pekskärm inte svarar brukar installation av matchande firmware lösa "
"problemet."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 58
msgid ""
"Printer drivers let the system communicate with your model. If the printer "
"was detected on your network or USB, installing the matching driver is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Skrivardrivrutiner låter systemet kommunicera med din modell. Om skrivaren "
"upptäcktes på ditt nätverk eller USB rekommenderas installation av matchande "
"drivrutin."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 63
msgid ""
"3D printer firmware enables communication between the slicer and the printer "
"hardware."
msgstr ""
"Firmware för 3D-skrivare möjliggör kommunikation mellan slicern och skrivare "
"hårdvara."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-
# manager/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 67
msgid ""
"Scanner drivers (SANE backends) allow scanning applications to communicate "
"with your scanner model."
msgstr ""
"Skannerdrivrutiner (SANE-backends) låter skanningsprogram kommunicera med "
"din skannermodell."
